data: {"answer": "這裡是「會館碼頭・進貨與廠商」，主要處理供應商送貨及軟體維護等事務。\n在此可看到財務採購部（分機 1600）與供應商入口網站系統。\n重點防護措施包括廠商限時遠端存取、匯款變更回撥確認及廠商風險管理。\n需警惕商務郵件詐騙與供應鏈入侵威脅，若廠商要求換匯款帳戶務必先打電話確認。", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "供應商入口網站是做什麼的？", "en": "What does the Supplier Portal do?", "zh": "供應商入口網站是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "商務郵件詐騙要怎麼防？", "en": "How do we prevent business email compromise?", "zh": "商務郵件詐騙要怎麼防？"}, {"text": "接下來要去哪？", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "zh", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 11.73, "total_s": 11.74}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "pier", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "pier"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 7.7}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "pier", "label": "Room", "en": "Clubhouse Pier", "zh": "會館碼頭"}, {"key": "supplier_portal", "label": "System", "en": "Supplier Portal", "zh": "供應商入口網站"}, {"key": "bec", "label": "Threat", "en": "Business Email Compromise", "zh": "商務郵件詐騙"}, {"key": "supply_chain", "label": "Threat", "en": "Third-Party & Supply-Chain Compromise", "zh": "第三方與供應鏈入侵"}, {"key": "vendor_remote_access", "label": "Control", "en": "Time-Limited Vendor Access", "zh": "廠商限時遠端存取"}, {"key": "payment_callback", "label": "Control", "en": "Payment Change Call-Back", "zh": "匯款變更回撥確認"}, {"key": "vendor_management", "label": "Control", "en": "Vendor Risk Management", "zh": "廠商風險管理"}, {"key": "c_erp", "label": "Concept", "en": "Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP)", "zh": "企業資源規劃（ERP）"}, {"key": "c_supply_chain_risk", "label": "Concept", "en": "Supply-Chain Risk", "zh": "供應鏈風險"}], "edges": [{"a": "vendor_management", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "pier"}, {"a": "vendor_management", "t": "PROTECTS", "b": "supplier_portal"}, {"a": "vendor_management", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "bec"}, {"a": "vendor_management", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "supply_chain"}, {"a": "vendor_remote_access", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "pier"}, {"a": "vendor_remote_access", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "supply_chain"}, {"a": "supplier_portal", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "pier"}, {"a": "bec", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "pier"}, {"a": "supply_chain", "t": "TARGETS", "b": "supplier_portal"}, {"a": "supply_chain", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "pier"}, {"a": "c_erp", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "pier"}, {"a": "c_supply_chain_risk", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "pier"}, {"a": "c_supply_chain_risk", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "supply_chain"}, {"a": "c_supply_chain_risk", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "vendor_management"}, {"a": "payment_callback", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "pier"}, {"a": "payment_callback", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "bec"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "房間：會館碼頭・進貨與廠商\n代表的資訊主題：供應商從碼頭送貨；廠商也提供軟體、維護和遠端連線。\n重點：廠商要先評估；對方說要換匯款帳戶，一定打電話確認。\n在這裡的部門：財務採購部（分機 1600）\n這裡的系統：供應商入口網站\n這裡要注意的威脅：商務郵件詐騙、第三方與供應鏈入侵\n看得到的防護措施：廠商限時遠端存取、匯款變更回撥確認、廠商風險管理\n課程概念：企業資源規劃（ERP）、供應鏈風險\n相關的處理流程：廠商要遠端連線、供應商要求變更匯款帳戶\n可以走到：湖邊草地・集合點與營運持續、客人報到與無線網路（導覽裡的名稱：湖畔露台）、湖面上的小船・異地備份、蒸汽船甲板・行動辦公、泳池・資料湖", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 11.71, "load_s": 0.01, "prompt_tokens": 642, "prompt_s": 2.28, "gen_tokens": 92, "gen_s": 8.66, "tok_per_s": 10.6, "first_token_s": 3.05}}, "state": {}}

